    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d732">

                <pb facs="0950" n="939" sameAs="frus:frus1937v02/pg939"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">748T.62S15/7</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the British Chargé</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Mallet</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-10-20">October 20, 1937</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: The receipt is acknowledged with thanks of
                    your note No. 336 of October 4, 1937,<anchor n="1" xml:id="d732-f1"/>
                    transmitting for the information of the Government of the United States a copy
                    of a treaty between the United Kingdom and Belgium regarding the boundary
                    between Tanganyika Territory and Ruanda Urundi, signed at London on November 22,
                        1934.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d732-f2"/></p>
                <p>The Government of the United States takes note of this treaty without prejudice
                    to any rights which it may have in the territory affected, under the convention
                    between the United States of America and Great Britain signed at London on
                    February 10, 1925,<anchor n="3" xml:id="d732-f3"/> and the treaty and protocol
                    between the United States of America and Belgium, signed at Brussels on April
                    18, 1923, and January 21, 1924.<anchor n="4" xml:id="d732-f4"/></p>
                <p>Accept [etc.]</p>
                <closer>For the Secretary of State:<lb/><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hugh R.
                            Wilson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
